.env
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
staticfiles
# Phase 12 hardening: both Dockerfile stages COPY the whole build context (`COPY . .`) after already
# `pip install`-ing into the image's own site-packages — without these, the host's local dev tooling
# (a 200MB+ virtualenv; ruff's cache) got copied into the image too, on top of the real dependencies,
# for zero runtime benefit.
.venv
.ruff_cache
